+<details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan is free to use and includes unlimited messages for up to 10 members. No credit card required.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Yearly billing gives you 20% off the monthly price. You pay for the year upfront, and can switch plans whenever your team’s needs change.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. Change plans or cancel at any time. If you cancel a paid plan, your team keeps access through the end of the current billing period.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Move to a plan that fits whenever you’re ready. Team and Business pricing is per user, so your bill adjusts as your member count changes.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you offer help with migration?</summary><p>We do. Our support team can help bring your conversations and files over. Business customers also get dedicated support.</p></details>
